<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cognifyz - Submission Successful (Task 1)</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #10b981;
      --primary-hover: #059669;
      --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #064e3b 100%);
      --card-bg: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-gradient);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .success-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
      color: #34d399;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .data-table {
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    .data-row {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .data-label {
      padding: 1rem 0;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      width: 35%;
    }

    .data-value {
      padding: 1rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: white;
    }

    .feedback-box {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .btn-back {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.875rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-back:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="success-badge">
        <span>✓</span> Data Rendered Successfully
      </div>
      
      <h1>Submission Received!</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">EJS server-side template generated successfully.</p>

      <table class="data-table">
        <tr class="data-row">
          <td class="data-label">Full Name</td>
          <td class="data-value"><%= name %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="data-row">
          <td class="data-label">Email</td>
          <td class="data-value"><%= email %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="data-row">
          <td class="data-label">Professional Role</td>
          <td class="data-value"><%= role %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="data-row">
          <td class="data-label">Feedback</td>
          <td class="data-value">
            <div class="feedback-box"><%= feedback %></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <a href="/" class="btn-back">← Go Back to Form</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
